@startuml Sequence_Dropout_Reconnection
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

actor Client1 as "Client 1 (Healthy)"
actor Client2 as "Client 2 (Drops out / Reconnects)"
participant Gateway as "FastAPI Gateway"
database DB as "PostgreSQL"
participant Coordinator as "Coordinator\n(separate process)"

== Round t: Temporary Connection Failure and Retry (Client 1) ==
Client1 -> Gateway : POST /update (round t, update_id = U1)
Gateway -> DB : Save update U1
Gateway -x Client1 : 200 OK lost (connection drops)
Client1 -> Client1 : Exponential backoff + jitter
Client1 -> Gateway : POST /update (round t, same update_id = U1)
Gateway -> DB : U1 already accepted
Gateway --> Client1 : 200 OK (idempotent, not counted twice)

== Round t: Client 2 Drops Out ==
Note over Client2 : Client 2 loses its connection / crashes\n(no update sent)

Coordinator -> DB : Round t deadline reached: count accepted updates
alt All selected clients reported OR received >= min_participants
    Coordinator -> DB : Record Client 2 as DROPOUT for round t
    Coordinator -> Coordinator : Aggregate without Client 2
    Coordinator -> DB : Round t = DONE
else received < min_participants
    Coordinator -> DB : Round t = FAILED (reason: quorum not met)\nGlobal model stays at v_t
end
Coordinator -> DB : Open next round t+1 (new round_id)

== Late Update from Round t ==
Client2 -> Gateway : POST /update (round t) after the deadline
Gateway -> DB : Round t is closed
Gateway --> Client2 : 409 Conflict (stale)

== Round t+1: Client 2 Reconnects ==
Client2 -> Gateway : GET /task (client_id = Client2)
Gateway -> DB : Active round = t+1; is Client 2 selected?
alt Client 2 selected for round t+1
    Gateway --> Client2 : TaskAssignment (round_id = t+1, latest model version)
    Client2 -> Gateway : GET /model/{run_id}/{latest version}
    Gateway --> Client2 : Latest global model weights + SHA-256
    Note over Client2 : Client 2 synchronizes to the latest model\nand trains normally
    Client2 -> Gateway : POST /update (round t+1, new update_id)
    Gateway --> Client2 : 200 OK (accepted)
else Not selected this round
    Gateway --> Client2 : 204 No Content (keeps polling)
end
@enduml
